OL,3,GNEWSAHow West Midlands shed its gun
OL,4,Acrime capital label
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 10 years ago, the West
OL,7,FMidlands was dubbed the gun crime
OL,8,Fcapital of England and Wales.
OL,10,FIt was an area suffering from
OL,11,Fhigh-profile shootings. Gun fights
OL,12,Fbetween rival gangs were happening
OL,13,Fregularly.
OL,15,FFigures at the time reflected that
OL,16,Fnotoriety - there were more firearms
OL,17,Foffences per head in the West Midlands
OL,18,FPolice force area than anywhere else.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
