OL,3,GNEWSAHow West Midlands shed its gun
OL,4,Acrime capital label
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Back then, there were shootings every
OL,7,Fday, reported shootings every day and
OL,8,Funreported shootings every day," says
OL,9,FSimeon Moore, also known as Zimbo, an
OL,10,Fex-Johnson crew member - one of the
OL,11,FBirmingham's most notorious gangs in
OL,12,Fthe noughties.
